  "job_B1.3.23_20251001_193207": {
    "text": "X KALENDAS AUGUSTI, NATALE SANCTI APOLLONARIS MARTYRIS.\nON \u00d0\u00c6S CASERES DAGUM \u00d0E CLAVDIUS W\u00c6S GEHATEN, com se eadiga Petrus fram\nHi underfengon \u00fea Godes word mid gastlicre blysse, \u00fe\u00e6t God wolde asendan his sunu to mancynne,\n\u00dea w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r mid Petre sum arwur\u00f0e godes man Apollonaris gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6s halgan apostoles folgere.\nTo \u00f0am cw\u00e6\u00f0 Petrus \u00e6fter sumum fyrste, Efne \u00feu eart gel\u00e6red on eallum \u00feingum be \u00f0am h\u00e6lende,\nSwutollice \u00f0u wast \u00fe\u00e6t se is so\u00f0 Godes sunu, se\u00f0e deadum forgeaf lif \u00e6fter dea\u00f0e, and wanhalum\n\u00c6fter \u00f0ysum wordum se eadiga Petrus gehadode Apollonarem and gehalgode to bisceope, and his\nAppollonaris \u00f0a ferde to \u00f0\u00e6re fores\u00e6dan byrig, and sumne blindne mann geh\u00e6lde, \u00e6r\u00fean \u00fee he to \u00f0\u00e6re\nHe com \u00f0a to Rauenna \u00f0\u00e6re byrig and hra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6r geswutelode \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes mihte on wannhalum\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s sum for\u00f0 \u00feegen on \u00fe\u00e6re fores\u00e6dan byrig, se h\u00e6fde gehyred be \u00f0am halgan were, and axode\nApollonaris him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Ne cann ic naht on lacnunge buton on \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman; and se \u00feegen\nNu gif \u00e6nig miht is on \u00f0e, geopena hi mid weorcum.\nApollonaris \u00f0a andwyrde and cw\u00e6\u00f0, geopenige God \u00e6lmihtig eowre heortena eagan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge on \u00feone\nHe genam \u00f0a \u00f0\u00e6s wifes hand, \u00feas word clypigende, Aris nu on \u00f0\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman and on hine gelyf,\nHeo aras \u00fea sona andsund of \u00feam bedde, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t nan God n\u00e6re butan se h\u00e6lend \u00fee he embe\n\u00dea wundrode se \u00feegn his wifes h\u00e6l\u00f0e, and hi ealle s\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t se is so\u00f0 God \u00fee swilce wundra maca\u00f0,\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00fea gefullod mid his wife, and cildum, and eall his hyred on \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman, and fela\nApollonaris \u00fea \u00f0\u00e6r wunode mid him on Rauenna byrig, and bodode geleafan, and manega gefullode\nManega eac bef\u00e6stan sy\u00f0\u00f0an hi gefullode w\u00e6ron, heora cild to lare \u00feam so\u00f0f\u00e6stan bydele, and Godes\nHw\u00e6t se halga bisceop \u00fea on \u00f0\u00e6re byrig wunode \u00f0a twelf gear fullice, and gefullode \u00fea leode, and\nOn \u00f0\u00e6re byrig w\u00e6s sum \u00feegn Bonifacius gehaten, se wear\u00f0 f\u00e6rlice dumb, and his wif \u00fea asende to \u00feam\nEfne \u00f0a se bisceop eode to his huse, and an wifman w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6r wod on his huse, and se deofol clypode\n\u00dea gewat se deofol of \u00f0am wodan sona, and se bisceop eode \u00fe\u00e6r Bonifacius l\u00e6g, dumb on his bedde,\nHi cw\u00e6don \u00f0a amen, and on \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan tide wear\u00f0 his tunge unbunden, and he blyssigende cw\u00e6\u00f0, Nis\nOn \u00feam ylcan d\u00e6ge gelyfdon of \u00fe\u00e6re leode on God ma \u00f0onne fif hund manna, micclum \u00feancigende\nRufus w\u00e6s gehaten sum h\u00e6\u00f0en mundbora \u00fee \u00f0a burh bewiste, \u00f0a wear\u00f0 his dohtor seoc.\n\u00dea sende se f\u00e6der sona to \u00f0am bisceope, and sona swa he \u00feyder com swa sawlode \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den.\nHi weopon \u00f0a ealle \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6rinne w\u00e6ron, and se halga wer cw\u00e6\u00f0 to hire f\u00e6der \u00f0us, Ongin nu wel, Rufe,\nRufus him andwyrde, Efne heo is nu dead, ac gif ic geseo \u00fe\u00e6t heo eft gesund leofa\u00f0, ic herige \u00feonne\nMid \u00feam \u00f0e hi ealle weopon \u00fea eode he to \u00f0am lice, and clypode mid geleafan to Criste, and cw\u00e6\u00f0,\nHeo aras \u00fea sona, and mid hreame clypode, M\u00e6re is se God \u00fee \u00f0es mann us boda\u00f0, and nis nan o\u00f0er\n\u00dea blissodon \u00fea Cristenan on Cristes herunge, and \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den wear\u00f0 gefullod and hire modor samod,\nSe f\u00e6der swa \u00f0eah Rufus, for \u00fe\u00e6s caseres re\u00f0nysse, ne dorste geopenian \u00fe\u00e6t he on Drihten gelyfde, ac\nAppollonaris \u00fea wear\u00f0 gewreged to \u00feam casere and to witnunge gel\u00e6d, and on \u00feam witum geandette\n\u00dea woldon \u00fea Cristenan bewerian \u00feone halgan, and ofslogon \u00fe\u00e6ra h\u00e6\u00f0enra sume twa hund manna.\nSe dema \u00fea het l\u00e6dan \u00feone geleaffullan bisceop into blindum cwearterne, and on bendum healdan,\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a on \u00feone feor\u00f0an d\u00e6g het se fores\u00e6da dema gel\u00e6dan \u00f0one halgan on heardre racenteage,\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s sum \u00e6\u00f0elboren man, atelice hreoflig; \u00fea axode se bisceop, wylt \u00f0u beon hal?\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic wylle; and him andwyrde se halga bisceop, Gelyf on H\u00e6lend crist; and se h\u00e6\u00f0ena him\nAppollonaris \u00f0a hrepode \u00feone untruman hreoflian on \u00f0\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman, and he wear\u00f0 hal sona,\n\u00dea awearp se geh\u00e6leda his h\u00e6\u00f0enscype him fram, and gelyfde on \u00f0one H\u00e6lend, and mid geleafan\nHit gelamp \u00fea \u00e6fter fyrste \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea ungeleaffullan h\u00e6\u00f0enan gebundon \u00feone bisceop, and to \u00f0\u00e6re byrig\n\u00d0a geb\u00e6d hine se bisceop bealdlice to Gode, and heora deofolgild wear\u00f0 towend, and heora templ\n\u00dea gesawon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan \u00fe\u00e6s halgan weres mihte, and clypodon mid gehlyde, be \u00f0am geleaffullan\n\u00dea blissodon \u00fea Cristenan, and cw\u00e6don mid geleafan, \u00fe\u00e6t se ana is so\u00f0 God \u00fee swylce wundra wyrc\u00f0.\n\u00dea bet\u00e6hton \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan \u00feone halgan wer to slege sumum arleasum cwellere, se w\u00e6s geciged Taurus;\nAppollonaris him andwyrde, Nis \u00f0eos nan o\u00f0er miht butan H\u00e6lendes Cristes, and we habba\u00f0 Godes\nGedo \u00fe\u00e6t he geseo on \u00feines drihtnes naman, and we sona gelyfa\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he is so\u00f0lice God; elles we \u00f0e\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se bisceop him to, Cume se blinda to me.\n\u00dea com se blinda him to, and he cw\u00e6\u00f0 mid geleafan, On \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes naman geopena \u00fein eagan and\nHi wundrodon \u00fea ealle, and anmodlice cw\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t se w\u00e6re so\u00f0 God \u00fee swylce wundra worhte; and\nTaurus \u00fea brohte \u00feone bisceop digellice, of \u00f0\u00e6s folces gehlyde to sumum his landa, and hine \u00fe\u00e6r\n\u00dea sendon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0engildan mid hetelicum ge\u00f0ance \u00e6rende to \u00feam casere, \u00fe\u00e6t he acwellan hete \u00feone\n\u00d0a sende se casere sona him \u00feis gewrit, Gif \u00e6nig man gremige ure godas dyrstiglice, gebete he wi\u00f0 hi\nBeo\u00f0 ge gesunde.\n\u00dea het se burhealdor \u00feone bisceop him to gefeccan, and axode hine sona hwylcere eawf\u00e6stnysse he\nSe dema hatte Demosten, and he w\u00e6s deofles biggencga.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga wer to \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enan deman, Ic eom so\u00f0lice Cristen, and sanctus PETRUS me\nDemosten \u00fea andwyrde \u00f0am arwur\u00f0an halgan, Hw\u00e6t sceall hit swa langsum, efne nu is se tima \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u\nAppollonaris him andwyrde, Ic offrige me sylfne for minum gastlicum bearnum \u00fee ic her Gode\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Demosten deoflice wear\u00f0 gehathyrt, and bet\u00e6hte \u00feone halgan sumum hundredes ealdre to\nSe hundredes ealdor w\u00e6s \u00f0am h\u00e6\u00f0enan bediglod, and w\u00e6s digellice Cristen, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam\nHe eode \u00f0a nihtes \u00fe\u00e6t he his life geburge, ac \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan wurdon w\u00e6re his fare and hine gel\u00e6hton,\nHe wear\u00f0 swa\u00feeah gebroht \u00feurh his gebro\u00f0ra \u00feenunge eft to \u00f0am Cristenum, and he anbidode on life\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0, ic secge eow \u00fe\u00e6t swara ehtnysse becuma\u00f0 ofer \u00fea Cristenan for Cristes naman, ac \u00e6fter\n\u00c6fter \u00f0yssere tihtinge, and o\u00f0rum manegum spr\u00e6cum, gewat se halga wer of worulde to Gode, mid\nTwam l\u00e6s \u00f0ryttig geara he w\u00e6s heora bisceop on manegum ehtnyssum, \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan \u00feeowigende,",
